    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d243">

                <pb facs="0522" n="474" sameAs="frus:frus1868p1/pg474"/>

                <head>Mr. Seward to Mr. de Stoeckl</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1867-12-23"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >December</hi> 23, 1867.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to inclose an extract from
                    a dispatch of the 14th of September last, addressed to me by H. G. O. Chase,
                    esq., the vice-commercial agent of the United States at Nikolaievsk, Amoor
                    river, in relation to the alleged interference with American whaling ships in
                    the Okhotsk sea, and to the reported firing into one of them by Russian naval
                    vessels.</p>
                <p>I will thank you to inform me whether you have received any information on this
                    subject.</p>
                <p>Accept, sir, a renewed assurance of my highest consideration,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>WILLIAM H. SEWARD.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Edward de Stoeckl, &amp;c.</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d243-a1.xml" xpointer="d243-a1"/>
            </div>
